WEBVTT

00:16:29.276 --> 00:16:31.236
and other really, really powerful --

00:16:31.236 --> 00:16:34.916
including Iranian-supplied
kamikaze drones --

00:16:34.916 --> 00:16:40.956
this is attacking civilian
energy infrastructure on a regular basis,

00:16:40.956 --> 00:16:44.436
it's sometimes attacking civilian
residential buildings

00:16:44.476 --> 00:16:47.276
and ordinary people
are being killed and wounded.

00:16:47.316 --> 00:16:48.836
At the same time,

00:16:48.876 --> 00:16:52.876
what turned out to be a phenomenally
resourceful Ukrainian population,

00:16:52.916 --> 00:16:54.716
whether civilians or experts,

00:16:54.756 --> 00:16:57.716
let's just take now the engineers
in the energy sector

00:16:57.716 --> 00:17:00.396
are working around the clock,
day and night